[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322387825","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#issuecomment-3322387825","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110076","id":3322387825,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GB51x","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T04:38:36Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T04:51:03Z","body":"Got vulkan validation layer errors when opening the testing project:\r\n```\r\nERROR: Vulkan Debug Report: object - 18829136625681125\r\nvkCreateFramebuffer(): pCreateInfo->pAttachments[0] has mip levelCount of 8 but only a single mip level (levelCount ==  1) is allowed when creating a Framebuffer.\r\nThe Vulkan spec states: If flags does not include VK_FRAMEBUFFER_CREATE_IMAGELESS_BIT, each element of pAttachments must only specify a single mip level (https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/renderpass.html#VUID-VkFramebufferCreateInfo-pAttachments-00883)\r\n   at: _debug_report_callback (drivers/vulkan/rendering_context_driver_vulkan.cpp:665)\r\n\r\nWARNING: Vulkan Debug Report: object - 94033554464528\r\nvkCmdDispatch(): the storage image descriptor [VkDescriptorSet 0x42150000004215, Set 3, Binding 0, Index 0] is accessed by a OpTypeImage that has a Format operand Rgba16f (equivalent to VK_FORMAT_R16G16B16A16_SFLOAT) which doesn't match the VkImageView 0x3ec50000003ec5 format (VK_FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_UNORM). Any loads or stores with the variable will produce undefined values to the whole image (not just the texel being accessed).\r\nSpec information at https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/textures.html#textures-format-validation\r\n     at: _debug_report_callback (drivers/vulkan/rendering_context_driver_vulkan.cpp:662)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think for 1, you can try rendering to a texture slice with `mipmaps=1`. For 2, `CopyEffect::make_mipmap` is only used for rgba16f and needs change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322387825/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3331700743","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#issuecomment-3331700743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110076","id":3331700743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GlbgH","user":{"login":"codec-xyz","id":112908328,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrrYKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112908328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz","html_url":"https://github.com/codec-xyz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T02:56:32Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T02:56:32Z","body":"@beicause I can't reproduce the issue. When running the testing project I only get...\r\n\r\n```\r\nGodot Engine v4.5.beta.custom_build.86d993739 (2025-08-29 19:29:48 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nWARNING: GENERAL - Message Id Number: 0 | Message Id Name: Loader Message\r\n        windows_read_data_files_in_registry: Registry lookup failed to get layer manifest files.\r\n        Objects - 1\r\n                Object[0] - VK_OBJECT_TYPE_INSTANCE, Handle 1427672026032\r\n     at: RenderingContextDriverVulkan::_debug_messenger_callback (drivers\\vulkan\\rendering_context_driver_vulkan.cpp:639)\r\nVulkan 1.3.260 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: AMD - Radeon RX 590 Series\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot sure what this warning is about exactly but I also get it on 4.5-stable as well so idk if its actually a problem.\r\n\r\nEverything seems to work on Vulkan for me. I'm not all that familiar with `CopyEffect::make_mipmap` and `copy.glsl` but the shader seems to have output options of`r32f`, `rgba8`, and `rgba16f`. And looking at a frame in RenderDoc it looks correct.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3331700743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3332107374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#issuecomment-3332107374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/