,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T00:22:38Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T00:22:38Z","body":"Everything is updated to latest. Latest driver for my GPU has `Vulkan 1.3.260` if that's at all relevant. And installing the latest VulkanSDK got rid of the `windows_read_data_files_in_registry: Registry lookup failed to get layer manifest files.` warning.\r\n\r\nStill not encountering the issue, everything works fine on my computer.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336334881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336856514","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#issuecomment-3336856514","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110076","id":3336856514,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G5GPC","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T05:43:53Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T07:22:58Z","body":"I tested on Linux Vulkan 1.4.318 - Forward+, integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR)\r\n___\r\nThe first error means that you directly used the texture with mipmaps as the framebuffer color attachment somewhere. Instead, you should use the mipmap level 0 slice as the color attachment.\r\n\r\n>Everything seems to work on Vulkan for me. I'm not all that familiar with `CopyEffect::make_mipmap` and `copy.glsl` but the shader seems to have output options ofr32f, rgba8, and rgba16f. And looking at a frame in RenderDoc it looks correct.\r\n\r\nAlthough `copy.glsl` has rgba8 variant(`DST_IMAGE_8BIT`), the `make_mipmap` does not have a parameter to enable it.\r\n(This is not an issue with Mobile renderer (`make_mipmap_raster`) because `blur_raster.glsl` supports any unorm/sfloat texture formats)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336856514/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3342148123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#issuecomment-3342148123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110076","id":3342148123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HNSIb","user":{"login":"codec-xyz","id":112908328,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrrYKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112908328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz","html_url":"https://github.com/codec-xyz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-28T00:37:57Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T00:37:57Z","body":"I figured out why I was not seeing the errors. I was launching the project manager with `--gpu-validation` and opening the project. I needed to launch the project directly with `--gpu-validation`.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3342148123/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369771491","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#issuecomment-3369771491","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110076","id":3369771491,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I2qHj","user":{"login":"codec-xyz","id":112908328,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrrYKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112908328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz","html_url":"https://github.com/codec-xyz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/orgs